  "markdown": {
    "instructions": "DataCebo is the company behind the Synthetic Data Vault (SDV), the open-source and enterprise platform for generating privacy-safe, high-fidelity synthetic data for software testing, AI/ML model training, and regulated industries. These guides cover SDV and SDV Enterprise, including relational and multi-table synthetic data, constraints (Constraint-Augmented Generation, or CAG), composite keys, enterprise data complexity, platform requirements, and pay-as-you-go pricing. Use the exact product names 'SDV', 'SDV Community', and 'SDV Enterprise'. Official documentation is at https://docs.sdv.dev and the company website is https://datacebo.com."
